{"action": "type", "target": "[data-agent-id=\"10\"]", "value": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>FoodMania - Better than FoodHub</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b, #feca57, #48dbfb);\n            background-size: 300% 300%;\n            animation: gradient 15s ease infinite;\n            min-height: 100vh;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: center;\n            align-items: center;\n            color: #ffffff;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes gradient {\n            0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n            50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }\n            100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 40px;\n            max-width: 800px;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 4rem;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            text-shadow: 3px 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        .tagline {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin-bottom: 40px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #ffeaa7;\n            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        }\n\n        .food-card {\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n            border-radius: 20px;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n        }\n\n        .menu-item {\n            display: inline-block;\n            margin: 15px;\n            padding: 20px 30px;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            border-radius: 15px;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .menu-item:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\n        }\n\n        .menu-item h3 {\n            color: #ffffff;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .menu-item p {\n            color: #dfe6e9;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n        }\n\n        .cta-button {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            padding: 15px 40px;\n            font-size: 1.2rem;\n            background: #ffffff;\n            color: #ff6b6b;\n            border: none;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            cursor: pointer;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n        }\n\n        .cta-button:hover {\n            background: #ffeaa7;\n            transform: scale(1.05);\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            margin-top: 40px;\n            font-size: 0.9rem;\n            color: #dfe6e9;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <h1>FoodMania</h1>\n        <p class=\"tagline\">Better than FoodHub</p>\n\n        <div class=\"food-card\">\n            <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                <h3>🍔 Classic Burger</h3>\n                <p>Juicy beef with fresh veggies</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                <h3>🍕 Margherita Pizza</h3>\n                <p>Cheesy and delicious</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                <h3>🍣 Sushi Roll</h3>\n                <p>Fresh salmon and avocado</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                <h3>🍟 Crispy Fries</h3>\n                <p>Golden and perfectly salted</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                <h3>🥤 Cold Drinks</h3>\n                <p>Refreshing beverages</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"menu-item\">\n                <h3>🍦 Ice Cream</h3>\n                <p>Sweet treat for everyone</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <button class=\"cta-button\">Order Now</button>\n\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            &copy; 2024 FoodMania. Made with love for food lovers.<br>\n            Better than FoodHub since day one!<|close|>think<|sep|><|close|>message<|sep|>{"action": "finish", "target": "", "value": "The FoodMania website has been expanded with fresh code. It now features a colorful animated gradient background, centered layout with 'FoodMania' as the main heading, 'Better than FoodHub' as the tagline, a food card with menu items (Classic Burger, Margherita Pizza, Sushi Roll, Crispy Fries, Cold Drinks, Ice Cream), an Order Now button, and a footer. The code was written directly into the W3Schools HTML editor textarea."}

